  "title": {
   "en": "Nine to Nine"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "나인 투 나인"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "When your secret high school crush becomes your new boss, things can get complicated. Namin Kwon hasn’t seen Mr. Jeong since that fateful day at school when he lost control. Does his new boss remember him? Hate him? Desire him? It can be hard to tell sometimes. But spending time together, from client dinners to business trips, just might shine a light on the truth—no matter how unexpected."
  },
